        ],
        "notes": "\"Antem As-Sabiqun\" is a psychological horror game with intense violence and frightening scenes. Players will encounter disturbing environments and tense situations as they try to escape from a terrifying monster. The game includes frequent violent content, where the monster hunts and kills the human players. There are depictions of blood and gore during combat and other interactions.\r\n\r\nWhile there is no sexual content or nudity in the game, the overall atmosphere is intense, and the themes of fear, isolation, and survival may be distressing for some players. This game is recommended for players who enjoy horror experiences with a high level of tension and violence."
    },
